# Oracle VM crontab — REPLACES Vercel crons + the GitHub workflow pings
# AFTER cutover (see infra/oracle/README.md). Install with:
#   chmod +x /opt/onemarket/infra/oracle/cron-call.sh
#   crontab -e   # then paste the lines below (paths are examples)
#
# IMPORTANT: enable these only when the Oracle backend is live AND the
# Vercel crons are removed from vercel.json. Two ingest writers
# (Vercel cron + Oracle cron) against one Supabase DB waste quota and can
# interleave partial writes. Single writer at a time.
#
# Schedules mirror vercel.json (UTC):
#   ingest   05:30 daily  |  calibrate 06:30 daily
# S&P 500 shards are covered by the ingest universe flag server-side, so one
# ingest line suffices; keep the GitHub sp500-ingest.yml workflow DISABLED
# after cutover (or repoint its APP_URL at Oracle and drop this line — not both).

# 30 5 * * * /opt/onemarket/infra/oracle/cron-call.sh /api/cron/ingest >> /var/log/onemarket-cron.log 2>&1
# 30 6 * * * /opt/onemarket/infra/oracle/cron-call.sh /api/cron/calibrate >> /var/log/onemarket-cron.log 2>&1
